flattenVarDegrees -- turns a multigraded ring into a singly graded ring
***********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        S = flattenVarDegrees(R)
  * Inputs:
      * R, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 
  * Outputs:
      * S, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 

Description
===========

This turns a multigraded ring into a singly graded ring, summing the individual
degrees.

+-----------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y, Degrees=>{{1,2},{2,5}}];|
+-----------------------------------------+
|i2 : S = flattenVarDegrees(R);           |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i3 : vars S                              |
|                                         |
|o3 = | x y |                             |
|                                         |
|             1      2                    |
|o3 : Matrix S  <-- S                     |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i4 : degrees S                           |
|                                         |
|o4 = {{3}, {7}}                          |
|                                         |
|o4 : List                                |
+-----------------------------------------+

