isSeminormal -- checks if a ring is seminormal
**********************************************

  * Usage: 
        b = isSeminormal(R)
  * Inputs:
      * R, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 
  * Outputs:
      * b, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, true if the ring is
