|                                     |
|o2 = false                           |
+-------------------------------------+
|i3 : S = ZZ/5[a,b]/ideal(a^2-b^2+a^3)|
|                                     |
|o3 = S                               |
|                                     |
|o3 : QuotientRing                    |
+-------------------------------------+
|i4 : isSeminormal(R)                 |
|                                     |
