|       2         3             2         3      5               2    2       |
|E1*YRE1  - x*ZRE1 , x*XRE1*YRE1  - y*ZRE1 , ZRE1  - z, XRE1*YRE1 ZRE1  - x, Y|
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|------------------------------                                               |
|   5          3    3                                                         |
|RE1  - y, YRE1 ZRE1  - x*XRE1)                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : (ringToAlgebraMap(f, 5))#0                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
