================================================

  * "GF(...,Variable=>...)" -- see *note GF: (Macaulay2Doc)GF, -- make a finite
    field
  * "Grassmannian(...,Variable=>...)" -- see *note Grassmannian:
    (Macaulay2Doc)Grassmannian, -- compute the ideal of the Grassmannian of
